Bug fix: Tesla coil damage numbers now render above the effect.

This commit modifies 2 files (+32/-16 lines), spanning 1 TypeScript source, 1 task/ops files.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
- Set renderOrder = 50 on Tesla mesh so it renders before damage numbers (999)
- Added depthTest: false to Tesla material to allow damage numbers to render on top
- Damage numbers already had renderOrder = 999 and depthTest: false configured

Fixes issue where Tesla coil damage numbers were obscured by the wireframe sphere effect.
